; map entries without keys are rejected by design ("map fields need keys"), currently via panic.
; Pins that rejection: decaying to a silently-wrong `ok` is a regression; flipping to
; `error (graceful)` is a fix (re-bless). If keyless maps ever become supported, add the
; @name coverage promised in tests/comment-dsl/tests.rs.
no_key_map = {
    bytes, ; @name address
    uint   ; @name checksum
}
